  <h1 class="apj-h1">A Letter from Ruchika Gupta</h1>
  <div class="apj-letter">
    <div class="apj-letter-text">
      <p>For fifteen years, Aparajita has celebrated women who have inspired change, broken barriers, and transformed lives.</p>
      <p>Over the years, I have come to realise one simple truth: <b>every extraordinary woman was once a child with a dream.</b></p>
      <p class="apj-em">A child who needed an opportunity.<br>A child who needed someone to believe in her.</p>
      <p>That belief inspired the creation of <b>The Aparajita Institution</b>.</p>
      <p>Established in partnership with <b>Nishtha Foundation</b>, this institution is our commitment to ensuring that children&mdash;especially girls&mdash;have access to quality education, nutrition, transportation, life skills, and the confidence to build a brighter future.</p>
      <p>But our vision goes beyond the classroom.</p>
      <p>We are equally committed to empowering mothers and women through skill development and livelihood opportunities, because when a woman is empowered, an entire family moves forward &mdash; eventually aiming to impact <b>2 lakh lives</b>.</p>
      <p>As Aparajita celebrates its 15th year under the theme of <b><span class="apj-hi">&ldquo;&#2360;&#2366;&#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;</span> | Continuum&rdquo;</b>, The Aparajita Institution represents the continuation of everything we stand for&mdash;creating opportunities, strengthening communities, and transforming our nation.</p>
      <p>Starting with <b>20,000 girls</b> and then moving onto <b>2 lakh lives</b>, slowly and steadily.</p>
      <div class="apj-sign">
        <p style="font-size:15px; color:var(--apj-ink-soft); margin-bottom:10px !important;">With gratitude,</p>
        <p class="apj-sign-name">Ruchika Gupta</p>
        <p class="apj-sign-role">Founder &amp; Guardian, Aparajita<br>President, Sanmarg Group</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="apj-letter-photo">
